    "steam_appid": 2753950,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753950/extras/53eabb1b08a9be5b9c27f6b4505b2236.webp?t=1728923640\" width=600 height=36 /></span><br>PlatinumS is a roguelite top-down arena shooter that brings the ultimate hero's party-building experience to life, empowering heroes to conquer dungeons. Players have the option to select from a range of items and buffs to craft their own distinctive builds.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Party-based movement in a retro RPG style</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Automatically shooting when close to enemy</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Defeat enemies and collect dropped coins to purchase items and heroes in the store</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Each lord can lead up to five heroes</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Gain experience points to upgrade your heroes</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Each session with waves lasting 15 minutes</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>There are currently four playable stages</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Four optional lords</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>15+ different style heroes</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>30+ optional items to upgrade</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>70+ equipments in shop</li></ul>",
